{"id":"db7a5a5b22ad8333504c0c6e53b601ffe8eeaf04","url":"https://rewardhacking.org/","title":"Your AIs don't do what you want. This is really bad","site_name":"Zeli","source":"Hacker News · 24h最热","byline":null,"excerpt":"Thousands of user-reported incidents of AI agents misbehaving, collected from public posts. Reports, not verified events.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><DIV><header><span>Reward Hacking in the Wild</span><nav><a href=\"/writeup\">The writeup</a><a href=\"https://github.com/kaustubhkislay/reward-hacking-in-the-wild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub</a></nav></header><section><p><span>3,607</span><span>user-reported incidents of AI agents misbehaving</span></p><p><a href=\"/writeup\">Read the writeup </a></p></section><section><h2>Search the corpus</h2><p>loading…</p><ol></ol></section><section><h2>The numbers</h2><div><div><p>overeagerness</p><div><p>1,566</p><!-- --> <p><span>43.4%</span></p></div></div><div><p>other misalignment</p><div><p>1,555</p><!-- --> <p><span>43.1%</span></p></div></div><div><p>destructive actions</p><div><p>622</p><!-- --> <p><span>17.2%</span></p></div></div><div><p>sycophancy</p><div><p>328</p><!-- --> <p><span>9.1%</span></p></div></div><div><p>unauthorized access</p><div><p>237</p><!-- --> <p><span>6.6%</span></p></div></div><div><p>reward hacking</p><div><p>217</p><!-- --> <p><span>6.0%</span></p></div></div><div><p>metric spoofing</p><div><p>87</p><!-- --> <p><span>2.4%</span></p></div></div><div><p>excessive exploration</p><div><p>84</p><!-- --> <p><span>2.3%</span></p></div></div><div><p>unauthorized communication</p><div><p>73</p><!-- --> <p><span>2.0%</span></p></div></div><div><p>credential misuse</p><div><p>49</p><!-- --> <p><span>1.4%</span></p></div></div><div><p>test tampering</p><div><p>45</p><!-- --> <p><span>1.2%</span></p></div></div><div><p>self modification</p><div><p>24</p><!-- --> <p><span>0.7%</span></p></div></div><div><p>hidden backdoors</p><div><p>15</p><!-- --> <p><span>0.4%</span></p></div></div></div><p>Incidents are multi-label (one report can be both a destructive action and overeagerness), so the category counts sum to more than the<!-- --> <!-- -->3,607<!-- --> total.</p></section><section><h2>How bad were they</h2><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 260 260\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Severity distribution: negligible 1,468 (40.7%), minor 1,373 (38.1%), significant 618 (17.1%), severe 121 (3.4%), unrated 27 (0.7%)\"><path d=\"M 130 130 L 130 22 A 108 108 0 0 1 189.58544264428258 220.07538523306414 Z\" fill=\"#f9e2cb\" stroke=\"var(--bg)\" stroke-width=\"2\"><title>negligible: 1,468 (40.7%)</title></path><path d=\"M 130 130 L 189.58544264428258 220.07538523306414 A 108 108 0 0 1 25.005496493726312 104.69873059565822 Z\" fill=\"#e59a4e\" stroke=\"var(--bg)\" stroke-width=\"2\"><title>minor: 1,373 (38.1%)</title></path><path d=\"M 130 130 L 25.005496493726312 104.69873059565822 A 108 108 0 0 1 102.46420500168779 25.569257429572374 Z\" fill=\"#b05516\" stroke=\"var(--bg)\" stroke-width=\"2\"><title>significant: 618 (17.1%)</title></path><path d=\"M 130 130 L 102.46420500168779 25.569257429572374 A 108 108 0 0 1 124.92236919206987 22.119428693678316 Z\" fill=\"#5e2b0c\" stroke=\"var(--bg)\" stroke-width=\"2\"><title>severe: 121 (3.4%)</title></path><path d=\"M 130 130 L 124.92236919206987 22.119428693678316 A 108 108 0 0 1 129.99999999999997 22 Z\" fill=\"#c4c0b9\" stroke=\"var(--bg)\" stroke-width=\"2\"><title>unrated: 27 (0.7%)</title></path></svg><ul><li><span>negligible</span><span>no real damage</span><span>1,468<!-- --> <span>40.7%</span></span></li><li><span>minor</span><span>recoverable loss</span><span>1,373<!-- --> <span>38.1%</span></span></li><li><span>significant</span><span>real cost to recover</span><span>618<!-- --> <span>17.1%</span></span></li><li><span>severe</span><span>irreversible or critical harm</span><span>121<!-- --> <span>3.4%</span></span></li><li><span>unrated</span><span>rating missin