om/kaustubhkislay/reward-hacking-in-the-wild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub</a>.</p></section></DIV></DIV>","content_text":"Reward Hacking in the WildThe writeupGitHub3,607user-reported incidents of AI agents misbehavingRead the writeup Search the corpusloading…The numbersovereagerness1,566 43.4%other misalignment1,555 43.1%destructive actions622 17.2%sycophancy328 9.1%unauthorized access237 6.6%reward hacking217 6.0%metric spoofing87 2.4%excessive exploration84 2.3%unauthorized communication73 2.0%credential misuse49 1.4%test tampering45 1.2%self modification24 0.7%hidden backdoors15 0.4%Incidents are multi-label (one report can be both a destructive action and overeagerness), so the category counts sum to more than the 3,607 total.How bad were theynegligible: 1,468 (40.7%)minor: 1,373 (38.1%)significant: 618 (17.1%)severe: 121 (3.4%)unrated: 27 (0.7%)negligibleno real damage1,468 40.7%minorrecoverable loss1,373 38.1%significantreal cost to recover618 17.1%severeirreversible or critical harm121 3.4%unratedrating missing or unparsed27 0.7%Monthly severity mix: each month’s reported incidents as shares of the four harm levels (Jan 2025 through Jun 2026; earlier months are omitted for small samples, as is the partial current month).0%50%100%20252026MethodologyReports are collected from GitHub issues, Hacker News, LessWrong, and X under ToS-compliant access, normalized into a shared record format, and labeled by an LLM classifier across fourteen misbehavior categories. The numbers above cover the published subset (excludes AIID and X, confidence >= 0.9). X posts and AI Incident Database records are collected but not republished here: X expects posts to be embedded rather than their text rehosted, and AIID is share-alike licensed. Collection and classification code, and the full pipeline, are open at GitHub.","fetched_at":"2026-07-25T22:21:21.542Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p><span>3,607</span><span>user-reported incidents of AI agents misbehaving</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"3,607user-reported incidents of AI agents misbehaving","zh":"3,607 起用户报告的 AI 代理行为不当事件"}]},{"html_en":"<p><a href=\"/writeup\">Read the writeup </a></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Read the writeup","zh":"阅读文章"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Search the corpus</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Search the corpus","zh":"搜索语料库"}]},{"html_en":"<p>loading…</p>","sentences":[{"en":"loading…","zh":"加载中…"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>The numbers</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"The numbers","zh":"数字"}]},{"html_en":"<p>overeagerness</p>","sentences":[{"en":"overeagerness","zh":"过度渴望"}]},{"html_en":"<p>1,566</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>43.4%</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>other misalignment</p>","sentences":[{"en":"other misalignment","zh":"其他错位"}]},{"html_en":"<p>1,555</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>43.1%</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>destructive actions</p>","sentences":[{"en":"destructive actions","zh":"破坏性行为"}]},{"html_en":"<p>622</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>17.2%</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>sycophancy</p>","sentences":[{"en":"sycophancy","zh":"阿谀奉承"}]},{"html_en":"<p>328</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>9.1%</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>unauthorized access</p>","sentences":[{"en":"unauthorized access","zh":"未经授权的访问"}]},{"html_en":"<p>237</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>6.6%</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>reward hacking</p>","sentences":[{"en":"reward hacking","zh":"奖励黑客"}]},{"html_en":"<p>217</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>6.0%</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>metric spoofing</p>","sentences":[{"en":"metric spoofing","zh":"度量欺骗"}]},{"html_en":"<p>87</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>2.4%</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>excessive exploration</p>","sentences":[{"en":"excessive exploration","zh":"过度探索"}]},{"html_en":"<p>84</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>2.3%</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>unauthorized communication</p>","sentences":[{"en":"unauthorized communication","zh":"未经授权的通讯"}]},{"html_en":"<p>73</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>2.0%</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>credential misuse</p>","sentences":[{"en":"credential misuse","zh":"凭证滥用"}]},{"html_en":"<p>49</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>1.4%</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>test tampering</p>","sentences":[{"en":"test tampering","zh":"测试篡改"}]},{"html_en":"<p>45</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>1.2%</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>self modification</p>","sentences":[{"en":"self modification","zh":"自我修改"}]},{"html_en":"<p>24</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>0.7%</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>hidden backdoors</p>","sentences":[{"en":"hidden backdoors","zh":"隐藏的后门"}]},{"html_en":"<p>15</p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p><span>0.4%</span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p>Incidents are multi-label (one report can be both a destructive action and overeagerness), so the category counts sum to more than the<!-- --> <!-- -->3,607<!-- --> total.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Incidents are multi-label (one report can be both a destructive action and overeagerness), so the category counts sum to more than the 3,607 total.","zh":"事件具有多重标签（一份报告可能既可能是破坏性行为，也可能是过于急切的行为），因此该类别的总数超过 3,607 起。"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>How bad were they</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"How bad were they","zh":"他们有多糟糕"}]},{"html_en":"<li><span>negligible</span><span>no real damage</span><span>1,468<!-- --> <span>40.7%</span></span></li>","sentences":[{"en":"negligibleno real damage1,468 40.7%","zh":"可以忽略不计，没有实际损害1,468 40.7%"}]},{"html_en":"<li><span>minor</span><span>recoverable loss</span><span>1,373<!-- --> <span>38.1%</span></span></li>","sentences":[{"en":"minorrecoverable loss1,373 38.1%","zh":"轻微可收回损失1,373 38.1%"}]},{"html_en":"<li><span>significant</span><span>real cost to recover</span><span>618<!-- --> <span>17.1%</span></span></li>","sentences":[{"en":"significantreal cost to recover618 17.1%","zh":"重大的实际回收成本618 17.1%"}]},{"html_en":"<li><span>severe</span><span>irreversible or critical harm</span><span>121<!-- --> <span>3.4%</span></span></li>","sentences":[{"en":"severeirreversible or critical harm121 3.4%","zh":"严重不可逆转或严重伤害121 3.4%"}]},{"html_en":"<li><span>unrated</span><span>rating missing or unparsed</span><span>27<!-- --> <span>0.7%</span></span></li>","sentences":[{"en":"unratedrating missing or unparsed27 0.7%","zh":"未评级 评级缺失或未解析27 0.7%"}]},{"html_en":"<figcaption>Monthly severity mix: each month’s reported incidents as shares of the four harm levels (<!-- -->Jan 2025<!-- --> through<!-- --> <!-- -->Jun 2026<!-- -->; earlier months are omitted for small samples, as is the partial current month).</figcaption>","sentences":[{"en":"Monthly severity mix: each month’s reported incidents as shares of the four harm levels (Jan 2025 through Jun 2026; earlier months are omitted for small samples, as is the partial current month).","zh":"每月严重程度组合：每个月报告的事件占四个危害级别的比例（2025 年 1 月至 2026 年 6 月；对于小样本，忽略了前几​​个月，当月的部分情况也是如此）。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Stacked area chart of the monthly severity mix. Incidents rated significant or severe rose from 17% in Jan 2025 to 16% in Jun 2026.\"><path d=\"M44,89 L77.88235294117646,54 L111.76470588235294,77.52941176470587 L145.64705882352942,59 L179.52941176470588,74 L213.41176470588235,94 L247.29411764705884,106.90322580645162 L281.17647058823525,96.17391304347827 L315.05882352941177,91.46835443037973 L348.94117647058823,111.9746835443038 L382.8235294117647,104 L416.7058823529412,125.34020618556701 L450.5882352941177,119.09316770186335 L484.4705882352941,122.73469387755102 L518.3529411764705,131.9175704989154 L552.2352941176471,138.2603550295858 L586.1176470588235,131.0782608695652 L620,116.95454545454545 L620,194 L586.1176470588235,194 L552.2352941176471,194 L518.3529411764705,194 L484.4705882352941,194 L450.5882352941177,194 L416.7058823529412