7647,104 416.7058823529412,125.34020618556701 450.5882352941177,119.09316770186335 484.4705882352941,122.73469387755102 518.3529411764705,131.9175704989154 552.2352941176471,138.2603550295858 586.1176470588235,131.0782608695652 620,116.95454545454545\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--bg)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><polyline points=\"44,44 77.88235294117646,34 111.76470588235294,35.176470588235304 145.64705882352942,32 179.52941176470588,35.81818181818181 213.41176470588235,44 247.29411764705884,51.741935483870975 281.17647058823525,35.52173913043481 315.05882352941177,43.62025316455697 348.94117647058823,52.734177215189874 382.8235294117647,44 416.7058823529412,54.82474226804126 450.5882352941177,44.1863354037267 484.4705882352941,53.67346938775509 518.3529411764705,50.312364425162684 552.2352941176471,58.37869822485206 586.1176470588235,60.95652173913044 620,43.31818181818181\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--bg)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><polyline points=\"44,14 77.88235294117646,14 111.76470588235294,14 145.64705882352942,14 179.52941176470588,19.45454545454544 213.41176470588235,18.99999999999997 247.29411764705884,25.612903225806463 281.17647058823525,14.000000000000028 315.05882352941177,23.11392405063293 348.94117647058823,16.278481012658233 382.8235294117647,22.571428571428584 416.7058823529412,25.13402061855672 450.5882352941177,16.236024844720504 484.4705882352941,20.612244897959187 518.3529411764705,19.85683297180043 552.2352941176471,18.970414201183416 586.1176470588235,26.83478260869566 620,17.409090909090907\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--bg)\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><g><line x1=\"44\" x2=\"620\" y1=\"194\" y2=\"194\" /><text x=\"36\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"end\">0<!-- -->%</text></g><g><line x1=\"44\" x2=\"620\" y1=\"104\" y2=\"104\" /><text x=\"36\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"end\">50<!-- -->%</text></g><g><line x1=\"44\" x2=\"620\" y1=\"14\" y2=\"14\" /><text x=\"36\" y=\"18\" text-anchor=\"end\">100<!-- -->%</text></g><text x=\"44\" y=\"214\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2025</text><text x=\"450.5882352941177\" y=\"214\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2026</text></svg></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<h2>Methodology</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Methodology","zh":"方法论"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Reports are collected from GitHub issues, Hacker News, LessWrong, and X under ToS-compliant access, normalized into a shared record format, and labeled by an LLM classifier across fourteen misbehavior categories. The numbers above cover the published subset (<!-- -->excludes AIID and X, confidence &gt;= 0.9<!-- -->). X posts and AI Incident Database records are collected but not republished here: X expects posts to be embedded rather than their text rehosted, and AIID is share-alike licensed. Collection and classification code, and the full pipeline, are open at<!-- --> <a href=\"https://github.com/kaustubhkislay/reward-hacking-in-the-wild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub</a>.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Reports are collected from GitHub issues, Hacker News, LessWrong, and X under ToS-compliant access, normalized into a shared record format, and labeled by an LLM classifier across fourteen misbehavior categories.","zh":"报告是在符合 ToS 的访问下从 GitHub 问题、Hacker News、LessWrong 和 X 收集的，标准化为共享记录格式，并由 LLM 分类器在 14 个不当行为类别中进行标记。"},{"en":"The numbers above cover the published subset (excludes AIID and X, confidence >= 0.9).","zh":"上面的数字涵盖了已发布的子集（不包括 AIID 和 X，置信度 >= 0.9）。"},{"en":"X posts and AI Incident Database records are collected but not republished here: X expects posts to be embedded rather than their text rehosted, and AIID is share-alike licensed.","zh":"X 帖子和 AI 事件数据库记录被收集，但不会在此处重新发布：X 希望帖子被嵌入而不是重新托管其文本，并且 AIID 获得类似共享许可。"},{"en":"Collection and classification code, and the full pipeline, are open at GitHub.","zh":"收集和分类代码以及完整的管道在 GitHub 上开放。"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div><header><span>Reward Hacking in the Wild</span><nav><a href=\"/writeup\">The writeup</a><a href=\"https://github.com/kaustubhkislay/reward-hacking-in-the-wild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub</a></nav></header><section><p>3,607 起用户报告的 AI 代理行为不当事件</p><p>阅读文章</p></section><section><h2>搜索语料库</h2><p>加载中…</p><ol></ol></section><section><h2>数字</h2><div><div><p>过度渴望</p><div><p>1,566</p><!-- --> <p><span>43.4%</span></p></div></div><div><p>其他错位</p><div><p>1,555</p><!-- --> <p><span>43.1%</span></p></div></div><div><p>破坏性行为</p><div><p>622</p><!-- --> <p><span>17.2%</span></p></div></div><div><p>阿谀奉承</p><div><p>328</p><!-- --> <p><span>9.1%</span></p></div></div><div><p>未经授权的访问</p><div><p>237</p><!-- --> <p><span>6.6%</span></p></div></div><div><p>奖励黑客</p><div><p>217</p><!-- --> <p><span>6.0%</span></p></div></div><div><p>度量欺骗</p><div><p>87</p><!-- --> <p><span>2.4%</span></p></div></div><div><p>过度探索</p><div><p>84</p><!-- --> <p><span>2.3%</span></p></div></div><div><p>未经授权的通讯</p><div><p>73</p><!-- --> <p><span>2.0%</span></p></div></div><div><p>凭证滥用</p><div><p>49</p><!-- --> <p><span>1.4%</span></p></div></div><div><p>测试篡改</p><div><p>45</p><!-- --> <p><span>1.2%</span></p></div></div><div><p>自我修改</p><div><p>24</p><!-- --> <p><span>0.7%</span></p></div></div><div><p>隐藏的后门</p><div><p>15</p><!-- --> <p><span>0.4%</span></p></div></div></div><p>事件具有多重标签（一份报告可能既可能是破坏性行为，也可能是过于急切的行为），因此该类别的总数超过 3,607 起。</p></section><section><h2>他们有多糟糕</h2><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 260 260\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Severity distribution: negligible 1,468 (40.7%), minor 1,373 (38.1%), significant 618 (17.1%), severe 121 (3.4%), unrated 27 (0.7%)\"><path d=\"M 130 130 L 130 22 A 108 108 0 0 1 189.58544264428258 220.07538523306414 Z\" fill=\"#f9e2cb\" stroke=\"var(--bg)\" stroke-width=\"2\"><title>negligible: 1,468 (40.7%)</title></path><path d=\"M 130 130 L 189.58544264428258 220.07538523306414 A 108 108 0 0 1 25.005496493726312 104.69873059565822 Z\" fill=\"#e59a4e\" stroke=\"var(--bg)\" stroke-width=\"2\"><title>minor: 1,373 (38.1%)</title></path><path d=\"M 130 130 L 25.005496493726312 10